Package: sc-guest
Architecture: all
Depends: cloud-init, iproute2, ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: Strettch Cloud guest integration
 Lets cloud-init configure Strettch Cloud virtual machines from the
 platform's metadata service, sets the root password chosen at creation,
 and reports to the platform whether the virtual machine finished booting.
